From 2f546e031bd4a92c529de660428270a6b3e4085c Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Claude <noreply@anthropic.com>
Date: Fri, 15 May 2026 20:33:39 +0000
Subject: [PATCH 01/12] Add HAWK-512 and HAWK-1024 m4 scheme scaffolds

Drop-in skeletons for crypto_sign/hawk{512,1024}/m4/ with the canonical
pqm4 layout: api.h with NIST PQC entry points and HAWK Round-2 sizes,
params.h, and keygen/sign/verify C stubs. All entry points currently
return -1; the per-file headers track the work plan (Plantard NTT port
from UIC-ESLAS/ImprovedPlantardArithmetic, NTRUgen-based keygen with
M4 inline assembly in the recursive base case, isochronous CDT sampler,
reuse of pqm4 SHAKE-256 assembly).
